#: ../../source/docs/common-safety-switch-pixhawk.rst:5
#: 416d703c680f4767a172107ddbcbec5b
msgid "Safety Switch"
msgstr "安全开关"

#: ../../source/docs/common-safety-switch-pixhawk.rst:10
#: 993d3e5d0d2a469d9f06640bd5fec7bf
msgid ""
"A safety switch can be used to enable/disable the outputs to motors and "
"servos. The switch controls the \"Safety\" state of the vehicle. When in "
"this state, motors are prevented from operating (except in Plane's MANUAL "
"mode if force armed and the :ref:`BRD_SAFETY_MASK <BRD_SAFETY_MASK>` enables"
" outputs controlling the motors), a pre-arm error condition is generated to "
"prevent accidental arming, and servo outputs have their PWM disabled."
msgstr ""
"安全开关可用于启用/禁用电机和舵机的输出。该开关控制飞行器的「安全」状态。处于该状态时，电机被阻止运转（Plane的MANUAL模式下强制解锁且 "
":ref:`BRD_SAFETY_MASK <BRD_SAFETY_MASK>` "
"启用控制电机的输出时除外），产生解锁前错误条件以防止意外解锁，舵机输出的PWM被禁用。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-safety-switch-pixhawk.rst:12
#: 7b4f2f96175f4ff5bda4f85824112dcd
msgid ""
"the boards' hardware definition file must include this feature. it cannot be"
" added by the user."
msgstr "飞控板的硬件定义文件必须包含此功能，用户无法自行添加。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-safety-switch-pixhawk.rst:15
#: 96ce8a4b85c9471f95538c256eff7ab1
msgid "LED meaning"
msgstr "LED含义"

#: ../../source/docs/common-safety-switch-pixhawk.rst:17
#: d98faecd3a704629bee55a9f8f22f52e
msgid "Constant blinking - system is initialising"
msgstr "持续闪烁 - 系统正在初始化"

#: ../../source/docs/common-safety-switch-pixhawk.rst:18
#: 5ae29639a10c45a9935dc47e23d881b7
msgid ""
"Intermittent blinking - system is ready but in the \"Safety\" state.  press "
"the safety switch to enable output to the motors and control surfaces if "
"already armed, or to cancel the pre-arm error condition that prevents "
"arming."
msgstr "间歇闪烁 - 系统已就绪但处于「安全」状态。按下安全开关可在已解锁时启用电机和舵面输出，或取消阻止解锁的解锁前错误条件。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-safety-switch-pixhawk.rst:19
#: a9049a9a58d44ad59d2ad3b8d7035494
msgid ""
"Solid - safety switch has been pressed, motors and servos are able to move "
"once the vehicle is armed."
msgstr "常亮 - 安全开关已按下，飞行器解锁后电机和舵机可以运动。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-safety-switch-pixhawk.rst:22
#: 0b5bb9960a1149d7b9d2d4dccb3c8f39
msgid "Configuring the Safety Switch"
msgstr "配置安全开关"

#: ../../source/docs/common-safety-switch-pixhawk.rst:24
#: 56bf2f4056754f7a9f2449d237ef7f59
msgid ""
":ref:`BRD_SAFETY_DEFLT <BRD_SAFETY_DEFLT>` = 0 to disable the switch for "
"systems not equipped.(``BRD_SAFETYENABLE`` in older firmware versions)"
msgstr ""
":ref:`BRD_SAFETY_DEFLT <BRD_SAFETY_DEFLT>` = 0 用于禁用未配备安全开关的系统（旧固件版本中为 "
"``BRD_SAFETYENABLE``）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-safety-switch-pixhawk.rst:25
#: 657a0dab34a74f0e9a21d68178cbcef1
msgid ""
":ref:`BRD_SAFETYOPTION<BRD_SAFETYOPTION>`. This bitmask controls the "
"behavior of the safety button. It allows you to control if the safety button"
" can be used to enable the safety safety state and/or disable it, and "
"whether the button is only active when disarmed, and to force entry back to "
"the safety on state when you disarm. The default behaviour is for the button"
" to enter or exit the safety state, only when disarmed."
msgstr ""
":ref:`BRD_SAFETYOPTION<BRD_SAFETYOPTION>`。此位掩码控制安全按钮的行为。允许您控制安全按钮是否可用于启用和/或禁用安全状态，以及按钮是否仅在上锁时有效，以及上锁时是否强制恢复到安全状态。默认行为是按钮仅在上锁时才能进入或退出安全状态。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-safety-switch-pixhawk.rst:26
#: 21814f1b7b6243c2b3778842f34f5191
msgid ""
":ref:`BRD_SAFETY_MASK <BRD_SAFETY_MASK>` can be used to set which individual"
" channels remain enabled with the safety switch. This allows limited control"
" surface movements to check correct operation on the ground. Motor outputs "
"will remain disabled in all stabilized flight modes."
msgstr ""
":ref:`BRD_SAFETY_MASK <BRD_SAFETY_MASK>` "
"可用于设置在安全开关激活时哪些单独通道保持启用。这允许在地面进行有限的舵面运动以检查正确操作。在所有稳定飞行模式下，电机输出将保持禁用。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-safety-switch-pixhawk.rst:28
#: b393eecc3b1c4f82934af36c8788d720
msgid "Being in the \"Safety\" state"
msgstr "处于「安全」状态"

#: ../../source/docs/common-safety-switch-pixhawk.rst:33
#: 00a360919cc648ac9d22be27fefd7d37
msgid ""
":ref:`BRD_SAFETYOPTION<BRD_SAFETYOPTION>` This bitmask controls the "
"operational limits of the safety button. It allows you to control if the "
"safety button can be used for \"Safety\" state enable and/or disable, and "
"whether the button is active if armed. Also, if the \"Safety\" state is "
"forced on upon disarming."
msgstr ""
":ref:`BRD_SAFETYOPTION<BRD_SAFETYOPTION>` "
"此位掩码控制安全按钮的操作限制。允许您控制安全按钮是否可用于启用和/或禁用「安全」状态，以及按钮是否在解锁时有效。此外，还可设置上锁时是否强制启用「安全」状态。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-safety-switch-pixhawk.rst:36
#: 4c32ce6fd8af4b77bbef172a01400ccc
msgid "Using the Safety Switch to force I/O board firmware update"
msgstr "使用安全开关强制更新I/O板固件"

#: ../../source/docs/common-safety-switch-pixhawk.rst:38
#: fee1b503205a4bc5bf7fc8b3e935f9e9
msgid ""
"If the safety switch is held down for the first few seconds after the "
"autopilot is powered up, the I/O firmware is reloaded, if the autopilot "
"includes an IOMCU."
msgstr "如果在飞控上电后的最初几秒内按住安全开关，且飞控包含IOMCU，则I/O固件将被重新加载。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-safety-switch-pixhawk.rst:40
#: 062edc4dd96b4a878f9f07565be0ca56
msgid ""
"This is normally not required but in some rare cases is required after a "
"firmware upload if you hear the \"Start up Failed\" sound after startup (see"
" :ref:`Sounds wiki page <common-sounds-pixhawkpx4>`)."
msgstr ""
"这通常不是必须的，但在固件上传后启动时听到「Start up Failed」（启动失败）声音（参见 :ref:`声音wiki页面 <common-"
"sounds-pixhawkpx4>`）的罕见情况下可能需要此操作。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-safety-switch-pixhawk.rst:44
#: 1da79a55f2624393b154bc273dd4c7dd
msgid ""
"Many autopilots have two CPUs, the main CPU (aka FMU) is where ArduPilot "
"runs. The IOMCU is a separate I/O CPU which is responsible for some I/O "
"including PWM outputs to the MAIN OUT channels. Other autopilots do not have"
" an IOMCU, just the main CPU."
msgstr ""
"许多飞控有两个CPU，主CPU（即FMU）运行ArduPilot。IOMCU是一个独立的I/O协处理器，负责部分I/O功能，包括MAIN "
"OUT通道的PWM输出。其他飞控没有IOMCU，只有主CPU。"
